  "scale_policy": "Match neutral standing art height to the unchanged provisional native Height, divide out Actor.Scale, and report every posed bound. Moving arms and nonblocking horizontal death poses may exceed native Radius, as original biped art does; no collision or gameplay reach changes. Catalogue reference heights remain unauthorised.",
  "timing_policy": "Only existing inherited sprite/frame bindings; no action, AI, state timing, saved field, spawn or loot change.",
  "identity_policy": "Only CaelumBestiary008 Curupi, CaelumBestiary036 Gualicho, CaelumBestiary040 Uritu Orko and CaelumBestiary042 Maip are bound. Preserve documented identity/taxonomy and protected actors. No campaign placement.",
  "art_policy": "Four distinct owned-reference candidates: stocky adult Curupi with pointed ears, dark braids and rough leaf/bark clothing; gaunt ash Gualicho with long mask-like face, twigs, ribs, claws and ragged geometric cloth; human-avian Uritu Orko with beak-like nose, slate/ivory feathers, arm wing-feathers and talons; bony Maip with bird-like skull/beak, long hair, ribs, spikes and long claws. Fixed ornaments/clothes are art only; no shared taxonomy, metric scale, powers, rules, inventory or cultural claims."
}
